factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script says the youths fitted 'கண்கூசும் எல் இ டி முகப்பு விளக்குகளை' and drive vehicles with them, but the article says the glaring LED headlights are fitted; the reel_script is accurate here. However, the reel_script's claim that 'இதனால் சக வாகன ஓட்டுநர்கள் கவனம் சிதறி விபத்துக்குள்ளாகின்றனர்' is stated as established fact, while the article presents it as occurring ('விபத்துக்குள்ளாகின்றனர்' is the article's wording, so this is consistent)
  The reel_script states the 10,000 rupee fine as an existing penalty ('10 ஆயிரம் ரூபாய் அபராதம் உள்ளிட்ட சட்ட நடவடிக்கைகள் இருந்தும் பலரும் பின்பற்றுவதில்லை'), which matches the article, but the caption states it as 'உள்ளன' with the amount under legal actions; this is consistent, so no change needed for that point
  The reel_script omits the article's point that the stated 85–91 decibel limit is violated by silencers exceeding 100 decibels in its slides only in part; the reel_script does include the 100 decibel point, so this is not missing
  The slides_spec line 'இருசக்கர வாகன சப்தம் 85–91 டெசிபலுக்கு மேல் கூடாது' is ungrammatical in Tamil and presents the regulation limit as a directive; the article says the limit is 'மிகாமல் இருக்க வேண்டும' which is correctly rendered in the reel_script but the slide wording is garbled
